## Next Steps for the User
To see analytics data:
1. Ensure Web Analytics is enabled in the Vercel dashboard (Project → Analytics → Enable)
2. Deploy the project to Vercel (`vercel deploy` or via git integration)
3. Visit the deployed site to generate analytics events
4. Check the Vercel dashboard Analytics tab to see collected data
5. Analytics will show page views, unique visitors, and top pages

